        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "is",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect. \"Is\" is used with he, she, or it."
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "are",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect. \"Are\" is used with you, we, or they."
        },
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "text": "have",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrect. \"Have\" expresses possession, not origin."
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "A",
      "explanation": "El verbo \"to be\" se utiliza para expresar origen. Con el pronombre \"I\", la forma correcta es \"am\".\r\n\r\n---",
